# HAYA FerdausMix YouTube Pipeline (Required)

Reference channel: https://www.youtube.com/@FerdausMix  
Research docs: `research/ferdaus_mix/ANALYSIS.md`, `research/ferdaus_mix/PIPELINE.md`

## Distribution (locked)

- **YouTube only** — no RouteNote / Spotify for now (same model as FerdausMix).
- Public release = **~30–36 min DJ mix** of **9–10 tracks**.
- Individual ~2–3 min masters are building blocks; one master per song folder.

## Generation (locked) — Recipe 4

1. **ACE-Step** pure `text2music` via `batch_deephouse/haya_recipe4.py` only
2. Thinking LM on (`acestep-5Hz-lm-1.7B`), **~180s**, **108 BPM**, bright **C major / Rast–Bayati**
3. Leads by positive affect: **qanun → violin → oud → santur** (ney = sparse fills). **No piano**
4. Call-and-response Arabic vocals (tarab); instrumental **main chorus beat** drops = earworm
5. Generate **2 seeds**, keep the amazing take, delete the other
6. **Do not** use: Recipe 3, DiffRhythm hybrid, Suno, YuE, or FerdausMix extended-club prompts

Recipe 3 is deprecated (`haya_recipe3.py`). Approved legacy masters: Hawa, Rouh, Ward, Shouf, Baid (+ Noor, Yalil, Nafas).

## Post-production for YouTube mix

1. Collect 9–10 approved masters  
2. Hard-cut concat with `research/ferdaus_mix/scripts/compile_mix.py`  
3. Package under `batch_deephouse/output/<mix_slug>/`

## Title template

`Dark Mood — {ArabicTitle} | Arabic Deep Chill House Mix 2026 • Vocal House / Night Vibes`

## Style

Arabic deep chill house, feel-good night drive, female Arabic vocal (call–response), warm sub bass, four-on-the-floor + light darbuka, bright qanun/violin motifs, ~108 BPM.
